COBOLNET0828: INVOKE "MB": figurative-constant argument SPACE for formal 'B': the argument (a figurative constant or an ALL literal) is not a valid sending operand of a MOVE to the formal parameter (an elementary boolean item described with PICTURE 1(4) USAGE DISPLAY): a figurative constant whose characters are not boolean characters shall not be moved to a boolean data item (ISO §14.9.25.3 SR7)
